  "packageSize": 34917435,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView",
  "published": "1900-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Based on maui 10.0.15\n\nChanges since 10.0.14\nRelease workflow publishes to NuGet when dry_run is off (trusted publishing, nuget-org approval)\n10-client test waits 2 minutes before attaching browsers again (idle sessions must survive)\nServer stats tests: the app's own blazor.modules.json is served now (2 bytes fewer per client)\nParticipantsChanged needs relay 10.0.15\nMerge PR #85 (module, JS, relay, lifecycle, generator and system test fixes)\nREADME and release notes: sign-in providers, owner key, ParticipantsChanged\nAuthorization is injected, not compiled in: None, Fake (tests) and AzureB2C providers\nTests: owner URL carries the key; spoofed-owner test waits for the roster\nWinForms: OwnerKey is not a designer property\nWIP: owner key, names in the roster, ParticipantsChanged, session group check\nRemove UTF-8 BOM from embedded blazor.modules.json and clear CS8602 warnings\nUse bundled protoc 3.x binary in scripts/protoc.js on Linux CI\nFix bugs across module, JS, relay, lifecycle, generator, and system tests\nBrowser swarm keeps 300 separate clients, spread over 10 Chromium processes\nFix RunTests.ps1 packaging/tool issues, concurrent browser tests, and MSB3277 warnings\nRunTests: -NoBuild runs the tests on what the last run built\nLost-connection test cuts the viewer's connections itself\nA lost connection is shown and a /mirror page comes back; unattended hand-over retried; frames follow the latest control change\nWeb.JS test file as EditWebView writes it\nEditWebView keeps this repository's own changes across a run\nUpstream source from MAUI 10.0.130 and aspnetcore 10.0.15 (EditWebView run)\nDocument EditWebView in the release process.\nEditWebView: ask for tag dates only on the wanted major version, and print progress\nEditWebView prints what a run changed; Web.JS/src and test no longer git-ignored\nupdate packages\nEditWebView: fall back to the GitHub CLI sign-in when GITHUB_PAT is not set\nMicrosoft 10.0 libraries to 10.0.15, SDK 10.0.404; EditWebView re-applies the Web.JS patches\nControl test: a browser that has not been told yet is 'not agreed', not an error\nRestart test: wait for the restart to start before waiting for the page to return\nRunTests: -Filter for a partial browser run; restart test keeps the bar in view\nAgent: hand the requester the session's join link\nGenerator: voice, run-time choices, app-supplied startup values, and a restart that survives a stuck window\nLibrary: a restart request still restarts an app whose UI thread is stuck\nSession bar: opt-in Restart button\nShared control: one change of controller at a time\nVoice: a mirror page gets the remote end whenever nobody holds it\nRelay: every write to the app's stream goes through one guarded method\nShared control: a message from before a hand-off can no longer replace a real one\nRunTests: quote the -p: switch so PowerShell passes it whole\nRunTests: run every test project, quick suites first\nBugBountyTests: the mirror-scroll test ignores the control notices browsers are now sent\nControlTransferTests: the fake browser stream accepts the relay's token overload\nTests for sharing control: relay policy, render acks, URL loading, and end-to-end browser tests\nAgent protocol: 'requester' instead of 'technician'; consent fallback is 'Someone'\nUnattended address is control=remote; neutral wording in comments, package notes and the voice prompt\nSession bar: connection dot, neutral wording, host/remote names on the placeholder\nPackage release notes for 10.0.15\n10.0.15: generator ShareControl/Unattended, compatibility fixes, docs\nBuild warnings: WebView2 WPF reference, AOT-safe relay JSON/config, RS1032\nUnattended sessions: ?control=technician gives the technician control on joining\nRemote component frames follow control; roster in join order; document roles\nRemote component frames: role follows the page kind, not who has control\n\nFull list: https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView/compare/10.0.14...eedda77cab529ca84113b6b515e9c62b6969e76d",
